From f672a634850f14f92fba0f779132bd4319b01ac9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noam Lessner <nlessner@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 06 Jun 2021 16:59:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-37074] arch: move all asics to arch dir

To cleanup root directory of preboot source all architecture specific
code was moved under arch directory and Makefile was update
accordingly.

Change-Id: Ib7b31320a3430a7a8bfba5444ed3c55f6c65ca7b
---

